OL,3,A'Everlasting legacy' - Taylor Swift and
OL,4,ABeyonce lead tributes to Dolly Parton
OL,5,Aafter she dies aged 80
OL,6,
OL,7,FTributes have flowed for the legendary
OL,8,Fcountry music singer Dolly Parton, who
OL,9,Fhas at the age of 80 following a cancer
OL,10,Fdiagnosis
OL,12,FTaylor Swift says Parton was the "the
OL,13,Fgift that kept on giving", Beyonce
OL,14,Fcalls her "the north star", Sir Paul
OL,15,FMcCartney says it's "hard to imagine" a
OL,16,Fworld without Dolly, and Oprah says "we
OL,17,Fare all better because she was here"
OL,19,F"Dolly Parton's legacy is one of love,
OL,20,Fcompassion, and resilience," her team
OL,21,Fsays - read their statement in full
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
