OL,3,A'Everlasting legacy' - Taylor Swift and
OL,4,ABeyonce lead tributes to Dolly Parton
OL,5,Aafter she dies aged 80
OL,6,
OL,7,FParton's style was unapologetically
OL,8,Fbold, she wowed Glastonbury, starred in
OL,9,Fwell-known films and appealed to all
OL,10,Fages
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
